# E §4.2 step 3 / L §5.19 (round 16, the fresh critic's settlement): a decision instance on a covered day before K, or
# one an observation fulfils, is modelled past; "It is computed against the booked balances, which come from the
# observations ..., less its own observations (one dated before t was booked on its own day, step 1)". konto opens at
# 1 000.00 PLN; the observation r1 (300.00 PLN to savings, 2026-01-08, fulfils sweep[2026-01]) is booked on its own
# day: the booked balance on 2026-01-31 is 700.00 PLN. sweep on 2026-01-10 is computed against 700.00 + 300.00 (its
# own observation left out) = 1 000.00 PLN, so it moves 1 000.00 - 500.00 = 500.00 PLN, and `bal(konto, d) modelled`
# (E §6.2: the modelled-past instances in place of the observations on covered days) is 500.00 PLN (q).
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input keep: money PLN
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move sweep[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0, bal(konto) - keep)

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-01-08, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to savings amount 300.00 PLN, fulfils: sweep[2026-01]) "line 1"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-31), bal(konto, 2026-01-31) modelled

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 500.00 PLN "own"
  dom = 10 "own"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect
q: (700.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-10-20
